  - m_Id: 4917792786
    m_Localized: '<size=20><color=#73BFFF><b>CORE TEAM</b></color></size>

      Created by<pos=46%>Zachary Aars


      <size=20><color=#73BFFF><b>BUILT WITH</b></color></size>

      Engine<pos=46%>Unity 6

      Networking<pos=46%>Netcode for GameObjects, Unity Transport

      Online play<pos=46%>Unity Gaming Services: Relay, Authentication

      Bots<pos=46%>Unity AI Navigation

      Interface<pos=46%>uGUI, TextMesh Pro, Unity Localization


      <size=20><color=#73BFFF><b>ASSETS</b></color></size>

      Heavy and Recon weapons<pos=46%>Blaster Kit by Kenney (kenney.nl), CC0

      Rifle, handgun and shotgun<pos=46%>Unity template content

      Character, particles, sounds<pos=46%>Unity template and sample content

      Everything else<pos=46%>Made for this project


      <size=20><color=#73BFFF><b>SPECIAL THANKS</b></color></size>

      Kenney, for the free Blaster Kit

      The Unity community

      Everyone playtesting the pre-alpha'
